  "headExtra": "<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://videos.quickler.co\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@graph\": [{\"@type\": \"VideoObject\", \"name\": \"Graeme Clark, Ethos Safety: “A fifth, if not a sixth of the time.”\", \"description\": \"Graeme Clark, Director at Ethos Safety, on how little of the time goes on the task itself when you give Quickler a voice note and spend the rest of it with people.\", \"thumbnailUrl\": [\"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-a-fifth-of-the-time-thumb.jpg\"], \"uploadDate\": \"2026-11-23\", \"duration\": \"PT22S\", \"contentUrl\": \"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-a-fifth-of-the-time.mp4\", \"embedUrl\": \"https://quickler.co/graeme/\", \"inLanguage\": \"en-GB\", \"transcript\": \"Then think for three or four sentences and give that to Quickler as a voice note. And that is so efficient that we're maybe only spending a fifth, if not a sixth of the time actually doing the task. We spend the rest of the remaining time interacting with people, which is what we're there to do.\", \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Quickler\", \"url\": \"https://quickler.co/\"}}, {\"@type\": \"VideoObject\", \"name\": \"Graeme Clark, Ethos Safety: “On average, between five to ten minutes.”\", \"description\": \"Graeme Clark, Director at Ethos Safety, on how long it takes to edit a report in Quickler.\", \"thumbnailUrl\": [\"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-editing-time-thumb.jpg\"], \"uploadDate\": \"2026-11-23\", \"duration\": \"PT23S\", \"contentUrl\": \"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-editing-time.mp4\", \"embedUrl\": \"https://quickler.co/graeme/\", \"inLanguage\": \"en-GB\", \"transcript\": \"So now compared to before, the beauty with Quickler is we actually can see how long it takes to edit the report. It's taking, on average, between five to ten minutes. And some of this is actually because we've chosen to leave the activity of adding certain things until we go back to the office.\", \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Quickler\", \"url\": \"https://quickler.co/\"}}, {\"@type\": \"VideoObject\", \"name\": \"Graeme Clark, Ethos Safety: “Really working in the field without any sort of support.”\", \"description\": \"Graeme Clark, Director at Ethos Safety, on the moment Quickler really worked for his team in the field.\", \"thumbnailUrl\": [\"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-when-it-really-worked-thumb.jpg\"], \"uploadDate\": \"2026-11-23\", \"duration\": \"PT35S\", \"contentUrl\": \"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-when-it-really-worked.mp4\", \"embedUrl\": \"https://quickler.co/graeme/\", \"inLanguage\": \"en-GB\", \"transcript\": \"I think it was when we saw it really working in the field without any sort of support. And what I mean by that is we were able to do exactly the same as we did before report wise, but we were able to do it quicker and we were able to do it slicker. So what I mean by that is that we had the ability to actually generate a high quality report that needed very minimal admin or tidying up afterwards. And we were then able to bounce from that job to the next job.\", \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Quickler\", \"url\": \"https://quickler.co/\"}}, {\"@type\": \"VideoObject\", \"name\": \"Graeme Clark, Ethos Safety: “It was deceptively easy.”\", \"description\": \"Graeme Clark, Director at Ethos Safety, on how easy it was to capture the data on site with Quickler.\", \"thumbnailUrl\": [\"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-deceptively-easy-thumb.jpg\"], \"uploadDate\": \"2026-11-23\", \"duration\": \"PT29S\", \"contentUrl\": \"https://videos.quickler.co/graeme-deceptively-easy.mp4\", \"embedUrl\": \"https://quickler.co/graeme/\", \"inLanguage\": \"en-GB\", \"transcript\": \"I think it was deceptively easy. And what I mean by deceptively easy is it didn't feel like we were doing enough on site to capture the data that we desired. It felt almost like we weren't putting enough effort in using Quickler because it was deceptively easy to capture the data by purely just describing it or just taking a short series of photographs.\", \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Quickler\", \"url\": \"https://quickler.co/\"}}]}</script>",
